## 2. JavaFX Components Required

| Component     | Purpose                             |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `Label`       | Displays headings and field names   |
| `TextField`   | Accepts the bill amount             |
| `RadioButton` | Selects the tip percentage          |
| `ToggleGroup` | Allows one tip percentage at a time |
| `Spinner`     | Selects the number of people        |
| `Button`      | Calculates the tip                  |
| `Label`       | Displays the tip and total bill     |
| `VBox`        | Arranges components vertically      |
| `HBox`        | Arranges components horizontally    |

